  "notes": "Figures for the 73 four-car units of the 2019 option (MVG class T4.8): 219 places incl. 60 seats at 4 persons/m²; standing = 219 − 60 = 159 (derived). The four-car units of the basic 2015 order have 215 places incl. 65 seats. Tare weight approx. 45 t; motor power 6 × 100 kW (600 kW). Each of the four modules has its own centrally installed bogie (Siemens sheet for the first Munich Avenios, same length and capacity), so suspendedModules = 0. Entrance/floor height 300 mm. First delivery of this option was scheduled for 2021; the actual year is not stated, so yearIntroduced is empty. Height not given for this batch (the first-batch sheet gives 3,550 mm).",
